    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n*VIEWINGS BY APPOINTMENT*\n\nFour Bed A Rated Detached Home\n\nRi Na Mona is an exciting new development of just 23 homes designed to meet all family and lifestyle requirements ideally located close to Coill Dubh village and just a short stroll from all essential amenities and local services - Currently Selling From Plans. www.rinamona.ie \n\nThis development of A rated, concrete built homes boast the very latest in building and design specification with a choice of house types offering a variety of layouts, features and finishes that will appeal to all purchasers. \n\nCoill Dubh / Cooleragh is a wonderful village setting with a superb sense of community spirit and support. It offers excellent facilities including a primary school, shops, church, and a host of recreational facilities nearby including a playground at Timahoe, GAA, soccer, tennis and athletic clubs. Donadea Forest Park is just 7 minutes drive with wonderful walks and trails to enjoy and explore.\n\nThe proximity to and availability of all these facilities and more on your doorstep will entice purchasers searching for a quality family home in a convenient location. Commuters will appreciate the frequent daily bus service to Dublin city and easy access to the M4 and M7 motorways combined with convenience to rail links at nearby Sallins and Maynooth.\nDo not miss this opportunity to acquire a wonderful home in a super setting.\n\n**PLEASE NOTE IMAGES ARE VIRTUALLY STAGED**"
      },
